<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's August oil exports at 5.99 mln barrels.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's August oil exports at 5.99 mln barrels.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador exported 5.99 million barrels of crude oil in August, down from the 8.93 million shipped during the same month last year, the state oil Petroecuador said Friday.</p>
<p>Exports were down from the 6.32 million barrels exported in July 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The reduction of export volume was due to variations in the local market where consumption grew&quot;, said a Petroecuador spokesman.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, +5932 25-8433</p>
